                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fd0e288-7d15-3ace-acc9-b4ff3d82c638",
                        "entry_id": "8a1c111b-b6ca-3025-85b8-294b17c41601",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een constructie van horizontale latten op hoge palen, waarlangs allerlei planten kunnen groeien"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea6df0b9-0a81-4b77-97de-b50f6106e361",
                                "sense_id": "6fd0e288-7d15-3ace-acc9-b4ff3d82c638",
                                "text": "Ross en Fanjul waren zo goed bevriend dat de huidige minister samen met zijn vrouw in 2009 te gast was in Casa de Campo, een luxeresort in de Dominicaanse Republiek dat eigendom is van Fanjul. Ross’ echtgenote Hillary hield een verslag van de trip bij op de website New York Social Diary - inclusief kiekjes. Dineren al fresco, verse bloemen bij het ontbijt, boottochtjes naar verlaten stranden, en dan weer een yummy lunch onder de pergola. ‘De Fanjuls wonen in het paradijs’, concludeert Hilary Geary Ross in haar verslag, dat nog steeds online staat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13643786-6d3f-40e8-8049-de2816abd76d",
                                "sense_id": "6fd0e288-7d15-3ace-acc9-b4ff3d82c638",
                                "text": "Bij aankomst in Den Bosch woensdag kregen de jongens direct het ontwerp van Emiel Versluis onder ogen. \"Een uitdagend ontwerp, waarbij vooral de houtconstructie een lastig onderdeel was\", zegt Schoolderman. \"Een oase in de woestijn als ontwerp met zeer technische elementen zoals een pergola waar veel zaagtechniek aan te pas komt.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9974c99e-a106-4a5f-a7a6-5bfb0d6aa470",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a1c111b-b6ca-3025-85b8-294b17c41601",
                        "source_sense_id": "6fd0e288-7d15-3ace-acc9-b4ff3d82c638",
                        "source_sense_description": "(bouwkunde) een constructie van latten op hoge palen, waarlangs allerlei planten kunnen groeien",
                        "target_lang_word": "pergola",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pergola",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                        "entry_id": "a52a70b4-2565-3922-89f0-7c67846b710f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A framework in the form of a passageway of columns that supports a trelliswork roof; used to support and train climbing plants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "933ae368-fbcf-498b-a087-85322933a9bd",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "The thick vegetation met overhead, interlacing into a natural pergola, and through this tunnel of verdure in a golden twilight flowed the green, pellucid river, beautiful in itself, but marvelous from the strange tints thrown by the vivid light from above filtered and tempered in its fall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ddb0a68-5505-4996-a673-0a6f92157906",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "By the little garden pergola open to the winds some fluttered peacocks were blotted nervelessly amid the dripping trees, their heads sunk back beneath their wings: while in the pergola itself, like a fallen storm-cloud, lolled a negress, her levelled, polecat eyes semi-veiled by the nebulous alchemy of the rainbow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfc4f04f-4280-44f0-aed1-46f70baf3db6",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "While both pergolas and arbors are most dramatic cloaked in climbing, flowing plants, only a pergola will stand naked as a piece of architecture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e65fb97-6028-46e1-a78d-2a0d1a407a56",
                                                "sense_id": "5bfe59da-a09b-305d-bdf5-c9e6bca1d52d",
                                                "text": "When I first saw the movie, Chocolat, my favorite element wasn't the plot or the character development or even the cinematography. It was the cloth-draped pergola under which a very special birthday dinner was served."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fee03acd-444b-34aa-b38e-db1f600bb098",
                                        "entry_id": "a52a70b4-2565-3922-89f0-7c67846b710f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such a framework employed to provide shade, especially over a patio."
                                        ],
